\title{cortisol.nmea: NMEA modeling and simulation of diurnal cortisol curves}
\description{
The package has two layers. The method layer fits the asymmetric
scaled-logistic nonlinear mixed-effects model (NMEA) to a user's own
cortisol data through a configurable workflow. The simulation layer
generates synthetic pregnancy-trimester cohorts from aggregate summaries,
adds contamination, runs and compares methods, and reports the results.
}
